# What the cases of the buck2-farm action run as `./buck2`: each call prints
# the next recorded log of the case and ends as told (an exit code, a signal,
# a wait on a farm that never answers, or a read of a live farm's answers),
# and counts the calls and the `kill`s (assert_remote/stand_in_buck2.zig).
zig_exe(
    name = "stand_in_buck2",
    exec_compatible_with = LINUX_X86_64,
    src = "assert_remote/stand_in_buck2.zig",
